      "Activity Description": "Coaching teammates is helping others grow by guiding rather than directing. A coach helps people find their own way forward.",
      "Why Is This Activity Important?": "Growing people strengthens the whole team and builds independence over time.",
      "How Does the Activity Relate to Milestones and Deliverables and Workshops?": "It happens at intake and produces the personal growth roadmap. It supports agile coaching throughout a project.",
      "How To Complete the Activity": "Ask questions that help someone reflect, and support their next step. Use Notion to track goals and Zoom to meet.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Atlassian Agile Coach, with guides on agile, Scrum, and Kanban: https://www.atlassian.com/agile"
    },
