      "Activity Description": "Security protocol definition is setting the rules and procedures that keep a system safe. It is the security playbook.",
      "Why Is This Activity Important?": "Clear protocols mean the team handles data and access safely and consistently.",
      "How Does the Activity Relate to Milestones and Deliverables and Workshops?": "It feeds the network architecture and supports security work.",
      "How To Complete the Activity": "Define the rules for access, data handling, and response, and write them clearly. Keep them in Notion for the team.",
