      "Activity Description": "An information security audit reviews a system to check how well it is protected. It is a health check for security.",
      "Why Is This Activity Important?": "Regular audits catch weaknesses before they become breaches.",
      "How Does the Activity Relate to Milestones and Deliverables and Workshops?": "It feeds the network architecture and supports security work.",
      "How To Complete the Activity": "Review the system against security standards and note gaps. Record findings in Notion or a spreadsheet.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "OWASP, the open community for software security: https://owasp.org/"
    },
