      "Activity Description": "Sprint demo facilitation is running the session where the team shows the work they finished. It makes progress visible and invites feedback.",
      "Why Is This Activity Important?": "Demos keep stakeholders aligned and build trust by showing real progress.",
      "How Does the Activity Relate to Milestones and Deliverables and Workshops?": "It happens across sprints and produces the sprint demo presentation.",
      "How To Complete the Activity": "Prepare a short walk-through of the completed work and invite feedback. Present it in Notion or with presentation tools.",
