      "Activity Description": "Technical architecture creation is designing how a system will be built and fit together. It is the structural blueprint for the product.",
      "Why Is This Activity Important?": "A sound architecture lets a product scale and stay stable, while a shaky one causes trouble later.",
      "How Does the Activity Relate to Milestones and Deliverables and Workshops?": "It happens in requirements and feeds the system architecture, diagrams, specs, and database design.",
      "How To Complete the Activity": "Map the major parts and how they connect, weighing trade-offs. Draw it in FigJam and document it in Notion.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "MDN Web Docs, a trusted resource for building software: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn"
    },
