      ],
      "Activity Description": "Inventorying content is making a full list of the content a product has or needs. It is a stocktake of everything written.",
      "Why Is This Activity Important?": "Knowing what content exists reveals gaps and duplicates, so nothing important is missing.",
      "How Does the Activity Relate to Milestones and Deliverables and Workshops?": "It happens in the Implement work and produces the content inventory and outline.",
      "How To Complete the Activity": "List every piece of content and note its status. Track it in a spreadsheet or Notion.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Nielsen Norman Group, a trusted source for UX research and design: https://www.nngroup.com/"
    },
