      "Activity Description": "Developing a go-to-market strategy is planning how a product will launch and reach its audience. It ties product, marketing, and sales into one plan.",
      "Why Is This Activity Important?": "A strong launch plan gives good work its best shot at landing with real users.",
      "How Does the Activity Relate to Milestones and Deliverables and Workshops?": "It runs across discovery, vision, and launch and feeds marketing, positioning, and the go-to-market plan.",
      "How To Complete the Activity": "Define the audience, message, channels, and timing for launch. Build the plan in Notion or FigJam with the team.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Atlassian's guide to product management: https://www.atlassian.com/agile/product-management"
    },
