      "Activity Description": "Customer segmentation is splitting a broad audience into smaller groups that share needs or traits. It reveals the distinct kinds of people you serve.",
      "Why Is This Activity Important?": "Knowing the segments lets a team tailor a product and message instead of pleasing no one by aiming at everyone.",
      "How Does the Activity Relate to Milestones and Deliverables and Workshops?": "It runs across discovery, vision, and launch and feeds personas, positioning, and marketing.",
      "How To Complete the Activity": "Group your audience by shared needs or behavior and name each segment. Map them in Notion or FigJam.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Atlassian's guide to product management: https://www.atlassian.com/agile/product-management"
    },
