      "Activity Description": "Price testing is checking what customers are willing to pay for a product. It finds the price that works for buyers and the business.",
      "Why Is This Activity Important?": "The right price can make or break whether a product succeeds financially.",
      "How Does the Activity Relate to Milestones and Deliverables and Workshops?": "It happens in discovery and feeds the business plan and go-to-market plan.",
      "How To Complete the Activity": "Try different price points with real or potential customers and watch the response. Track results in Notion.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Atlassian's guide to product management: https://www.atlassian.com/agile/product-management"
    },
