      "Activity Description": "Documenting code is explaining how a product's code works so others can understand it. It is the manual for the software.",
      "Why Is This Activity Important?": "Good documentation lets new developers get up to speed and keeps knowledge from vanishing.",
      "How Does the Activity Relate to Milestones and Deliverables and Workshops?": "It produces code and coding documentation and supports the whole codebase.",
      "How To Complete the Activity": "Write clear notes on what the code does and how to use it, right alongside it. Manage it in GitHub.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "MDN Web Docs, a trusted resource for building software: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn"
    },
