      "Activity Description": "Deploying code is releasing software so it runs live for users. It is the step that gets the work into the world.",
      "Why Is This Activity Important?": "Smooth, reliable deployment is how finished work actually reaches people.",
      "How Does the Activity Relate to Milestones and Deliverables and Workshops?": "It produces code and supports launch. In agile work, teams deploy often in small pieces.",
      "How To Complete the Activity": "Package the code and release it through your pipeline, then confirm it runs. Manage releases in GitHub.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "MDN Web Docs, a trusted resource for building software: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn"
    },
