      "Activity Description": "Defining team process is deciding how a team will get work done, step by step. It makes the way of working clear.",
      "Why Is This Activity Important?": "A clear process reduces confusion and friction, so work flows smoothly.",
      "How Does the Activity Relate to Milestones and Deliverables and Workshops?": "It happens at intake and produces Kanban board statuses and the team process map.",
      "How To Complete the Activity": "Map how work should move from idea to done and agree on it. Set it up in Notion or FigJam.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Atlassian Team Playbook, practical plays for healthy teamwork: https://www.atlassian.com/team-playbook"
    },
