      "Activity Description": "Customer experience mapping traces a customer's whole relationship with a product across every touchpoint. It zooms out to the full picture.",
      "Why Is This Activity Important?": "Seeing the experience as a whole keeps improvements in one place from causing problems in another.",
      "How Does the Activity Relate to Milestones and Deliverables and Workshops?": "It happens in discovery and implement and produces journey maps and customer experience diagrams.",
      "How To Complete the Activity": "Chart each touchpoint and how it feels for the customer. Build the map in Figma or FigJam.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Nielsen Norman Group, a trusted source for UX research and design: https://www.nngroup.com/"
    },
