      "Activity Description": "Entity relationship creation is mapping the data a product stores and how the pieces connect. It is a blueprint for a database.",
      "Why Is This Activity Important?": "Getting the data structure right early prevents tangled databases that are painful to fix.",
      "How Does the Activity Relate to Milestones and Deliverables and Workshops?": "It produces the database architecture and supports development.",
      "How To Complete the Activity": "Identify the data items and how they relate, then diagram them. Draw it in FigJam and document in Notion.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "MDN Web Docs, a trusted resource for building software: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn"
    },
