      "Activity Description": "SEO design is shaping a product or site so it shows up when people search for it. It is about being findable, not just good.",
      "Why Is This Activity Important?": "Even great content helps no one if people cannot find it.",
      "How Does the Activity Relate to Milestones and Deliverables and Workshops?": "It happens in the Implement work and produces the SEO strategy.",
