      "Activity Description": "Creating research plans is laying out what you want to learn, how, and from whom. It is the blueprint for a study.",
      "Why Is This Activity Important?": "Planning first keeps research focused and trustworthy, so you get clear answers.",
      "How Does the Activity Relate to Milestones and Deliverables and Workshops?": "It happens in discovery and produces task analyses, affinity maps, and the research plan.",
      "How To Complete the Activity": "Define your questions, methods, and participants clearly. Write the plan in Notion or FigJam.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Nielsen Norman Group, a trusted source for UX research and design: https://www.nngroup.com/"
