      "Activity Description": "Rapid ideation is quickly generating lots of ideas without judging them yet. It is about quantity first, quality later.",
      "Why Is This Activity Important?": "Getting many ideas out fast helps a team escape the obvious first answer.",
      "How Does the Activity Relate to Milestones and Deliverables and Workshops?": "It happens in the Implement work and produces sketches and strategy definitions. It is often a group workshop.",
      "How To Complete the Activity": "Set a short timer and get every idea down, then cluster and pick. Sketch quickly in Figma or FigJam.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Nielsen Norman Group, a trusted source for UX research and design: https://www.nngroup.com/"
    },
