      ],
      "Activity Description": "Calculating statistics is crunching numbers to find patterns and check whether results are meaningful. It turns raw data into trustworthy findings.",
      "Why Is This Activity Important?": "Statistics keep a team from reading too much into noise or too little into a real trend.",
      "How Does the Activity Relate to Milestones and Deliverables and Workshops?": "It happens in discovery and acceptance testing and feeds analytics audits and research analysis.",
      "How To Complete the Activity": "Choose the right measure for your question and run the numbers. Use statistics tools and sanity-check the results.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Nielsen Norman Group, a trusted source for UX research and design: https://www.nngroup.com/"
    },
