      ],
      "Activity Description": "Measuring accessibility is checking whether a product works for people with a range of abilities. It tests how inclusive a design really is.",
      "Why Is This Activity Important?": "Building for everyone is both right and often required, and catching issues early beats retrofitting.",
      "How Does the Activity Relate to Milestones and Deliverables and Workshops?": "It runs across implement, launch, and acceptance testing and produces the accessibility analysis.",
      "How To Complete the Activity": "Check the product against accessibility standards and assistive tools, noting gaps. Record findings in Notion or FigJam.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Nielsen Norman Group, a trusted source for UX research and design: https://www.nngroup.com/"
    },
