      "Activity Description": "Site map testing checks whether a product's structure helps people find things. It tests the map, not the visuals.",
      "Why Is This Activity Important?": "A structure that matches how users think prevents a lot of getting lost.",
      "How Does the Activity Relate to Milestones and Deliverables and Workshops?": "It runs across discovery, implement, and acceptance testing and feeds research reports and the sitemap.",
      "How To Complete the Activity": "Give users findability tasks and watch where they go. Run it in Notion or FigJam and refine the structure.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Nielsen Norman Group, a trusted source for UX research and design: https://www.nngroup.com/"
    },
