      "Activity Description": "Copywriting is writing the words in a product and its marketing to guide and persuade people. Words do a lot of quiet work in a product.",
      "Why Is This Activity Important?": "Clear, well-crafted words guide users and build trust, while confusing ones lose them.",
      "How Does the Activity Relate to Milestones and Deliverables and Workshops?": "It happens in the Implement work and produces the copywriting document and microcopy.",
      "How To Complete the Activity": "Write clearly for the reader, then trim anything extra. Draft in Figma or Notion, following the style guide.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Nielsen Norman Group, a trusted source for UX research and design: https://www.nngroup.com/"
    },
