      "Activity Description": "Database creation is building the structure that stores and organizes a product's data. It is where the product's memory lives.",
      "Why Is This Activity Important?": "A well-built database keeps a product fast and reliable and prevents messy data problems.",
      "How Does the Activity Relate to Milestones and Deliverables and Workshops?": "It happens in requirements and produces entity relationship diagrams and the database architecture.",
      "How To Complete the Activity": "Set up the tables and relationships from the data model, then test them. Build it in your IDE.",
