      ],
      "Activity Description": "Collecting analytics is gathering data on how people actually use a product. It shows real behavior, not just opinions.",
      "Why Is This Activity Important?": "Usage data reveals what people really do, which often differs from what they say.",
      "How Does the Activity Relate to Milestones and Deliverables and Workshops?": "It runs across discovery, requirements, implement, and acceptance testing and feeds the UX audit and analytics audit.",
      "How To Complete the Activity": "Set up tracking for the actions that matter and gather the data. Review it in Notion.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Nielsen Norman Group, a trusted source for UX research and design: https://www.nngroup.com/"
    },
