      "Activity Description": "Product backlog maintenance is keeping the backlog current, clear, and well-ordered. A backlog only helps if it stays healthy.",
      "Why Is This Activity Important?": "A tidy backlog means the team always knows what is worth doing next.",
      "How Does the Activity Relate to Milestones and Deliverables and Workshops?": "It runs through discovery and requirements and produces the refined backlog.",
