      "Activity Description": "Release vision definition is deciding what a specific release is really trying to achieve. It sets the point of the release.",
      "Why Is This Activity Important?": "A clear release vision keeps the work focused on an outcome, not just a list of features.",
      "How Does the Activity Relate to Milestones and Deliverables and Workshops?": "It runs across discovery, vision, and launch and feeds vision boards, the release plan, and the pitch deck.",
      "How To Complete the Activity": "Describe what the release should accomplish and why it matters. Shape it in Figma with the team.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Atlassian's guide to product management: https://www.atlassian.com/agile/product-management"
    },
