      ],
      "Activity Description": "Optimizing SEO is improving an existing product or site so it ranks better in search. It is tuning what is already there to be found more.",
      "Why Is This Activity Important?": "Better search visibility connects a product to the people already looking for it.",
      "How Does the Activity Relate to Milestones and Deliverables and Workshops?": "It happens in the Implement work and produces the SEO strategy.",
      "How To Complete the Activity": "Review current performance, then improve content, structure, and keywords. Work in Notion and Figma.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Nielsen Norman Group, a trusted source for UX research and design: https://www.nngroup.com/"
    },
