      "Activity Description": "Creating annotations is adding notes to a design that explain how it should work. It fills in what a picture alone cannot show.",
      "Why Is This Activity Important?": "Annotations make sure design intent survives the handoff to developers.",
      "How Does the Activity Relate to Milestones and Deliverables and Workshops?": "It happens in the Implement work and produces UI development specifications and design annotations.",
      "How To Complete the Activity": "Mark up the design with clear notes on behavior and detail. Add them right in Figma.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Nielsen Norman Group, a trusted source for UX research and design: https://www.nngroup.com/"
    },
