      ],
      "Activity Description": "Maintaining the client relationship is keeping communication clear and trust strong with the client throughout a project. It is the steady human connection behind the work.",
      "Why Is This Activity Important?": "A healthy client relationship prevents misunderstandings and keeps a project on solid ground.",
      "How Does the Activity Relate to Milestones and Deliverables and Workshops?": "It runs across the project and produces the statement of work. It supports account and project management.",
      "How To Complete the Activity": "Check in regularly, set clear expectations, and follow through. Keep notes and agreements organized for reference.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Atlassian Agile Coach, with guides on agile, Scrum, and Kanban: https://www.atlassian.com/agile"
    },
