      "Activity Description": "Investigating competitors is studying similar products to learn what they do well and poorly. It reads the competitive field.",
      "Why Is This Activity Important?": "Knowing the competition helps a team find gaps to fill and mistakes to avoid.",
      "How Does the Activity Relate to Milestones and Deliverables and Workshops?": "It happens in discovery and produces the competitive analysis.",
      "How To Complete the Activity": "Review competing products against clear criteria and note the takeaways. Organize findings in a spreadsheet or Notion.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Atlassian's guide to product management: https://www.atlassian.com/agile/product-management"
    },
