      "Activity Description": "Choosing an agile method is picking the way of working that fits the team, like Scrum or Kanban. It sets the team's rhythm.",
      "Why Is This Activity Important?": "The right method gives everyone a shared, proven way to plan, build, and improve.",
      "How Does the Activity Relate to Milestones and Deliverables and Workshops?": "It happens at intake and produces the agile method decision.",
      "How To Complete the Activity": "Weigh the options against how the team works, then agree on one. Decide it together in Notion or FigJam.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Atlassian Team Playbook, practical plays for healthy teamwork: https://www.atlassian.com/team-playbook"
