      "Activity Description": "Leading agile transformation is helping a team or organization shift to agile ways of working. It is guiding real change in how people work.",
      "Why Is This Activity Important?": "Done well, it makes a team faster, more collaborative, and more resilient.",
      "How Does the Activity Relate to Milestones and Deliverables and Workshops?": "It happens at intake and produces the RACI chart, process map, agile method, and team charter.",
      "How To Complete the Activity": "Assess how things work now, guide the team toward new habits, and support the change. Facilitate it in FigJam and track in Notion.",
      "Where Can I Learn More?": "Atlassian Team Playbook, practical plays for healthy teamwork: https://www.atlassian.com/team-playbook"
    },
